{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24513","headline":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 三 · 白居易","name":"开成大行皇帝挽歌词四首奉敕撰进 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严恭七月礼，哀恸万人心。\n地感胜秋气，天愁结夕阴。\n鼎湖龙渐远，蒙汜日初沈。\n唯有云韶乐，长留治世音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}